{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3222","id":3595526986,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz887WT2NK","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3222","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3222.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3222.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3222","number":3222,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":".github: gate PRs via mitchellh/vouch","user":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"PRs keep arriving without the prior discussion `CONTRIBUTING.md` asks\r\nfor. We are not able to review or triage PRs fast enough, specially now that everyone has super human code generation capabilities.\r\n\r\nAdopt [mitchellh/vouch](https://github.com/mitchellh/vouch) to\r\nauto-close PRs from authors not on `.github/VOUCHED.td`. Issues stay\r\nopen to everyone — the close message points contributors back at\r\n`CONTRIBUTING.md` to start that discussion.\r\n\r\nLess aggressive than ghostty, which gates issues too.\r\n\r\nSeed list is past PR contributors with merged code plus authors of\r\ndetailed issues; bots and CODEOWNERS are auto-vouched. Anyone with an\r\nopen PR that hasn't been through review yet was left off — `!vouch`\r\nlater if it lands.\r\n\r\n`!vouch @user` / `!denounce @user` / `!unvouch @user` on any issue or PR\r\ncomment from a maintainer manages the list. Weekly cron resyncs\r\nCODEOWNERS.\r\n\r\nWorkflows need a GitHub App with Contents/Issues/PRs write installed on\r\nthe repo, plus `VOUCH_APP_ID` and `VOUCH_APP_PRIVATE_KEY` secrets. Until\r\nthose exist nothing is gated (fail-open).\r\n\r\n> Generated with the help of an AI assistant","created_at":"2026-04-28T11:22:34Z","updated_at":"2026-05-04T13:27:49Z","closed_at":"2026-05-04T13:27:49Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"d0408ba9ce8465dd568c7abf3f97fc8b24938b0e","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3222/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3222/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3222/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/statuses/56704d28097e7dfe72775d1d4985433eb8402ec2","head":{"label":"kradalby:investigation/vouch-pr-gating","ref":"investigation/vouch-pr-gating","sha":"56704d28097e7dfe72775d1d4985433eb8402ec2","user":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalb